## Quantitative residual

Best banked primitive scale:

`Q V (log X)^(C0)`

Required:

`Q V (log X)^(-A)`

Therefore the reduced primitive node has **no remaining fixed-power deficit**.
The open analytic requirement is arbitrary-log joint decorrelation on the
rank-one determinant-2 unipotent orbit.

The low-conductor / low-frequency pretentious profile is already routed.
The surviving inverse obstruction is high-conductor, high-line-frequency,
or genuinely distributed.

